      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tecate%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Founded in 1892, Tecate was honored as a Pueblo Magico in 2012 by Mexico’s tourism agency SECTUR.",
